[I] Library to access SMI management information

[T] libsmi is a library to access SMI MIB information for SNMP, parsing
[T] SMIv1/v2 and SMIng modules. It comes with tools such as smilint to
[T] check, smidump to convert and smiquery to query MIB modules.

[U] https://www.ibr.cs.tu-bs.de/projects/libsmi/

[A] Libsmi Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

